# AI Security Guardian - Environment Configuration Template
# Copy this to .env and fill in your keys.

# --- AI CORE ---
# OpenAI API Key (Required for GPT-4 features)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here

# --- NOTIFICATIONS ---
